<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Sarah, my love, this will go exactly the same way, whether you interrupt or not. Shall we save us both the tedium?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah blushed, and pushed her resentment down.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91The disc was in the room you shared with Tony before his arrest.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91I swear, I have no idea\'97\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Eloise hushed Sarah with the simple decisive raising of her palm. She sucked her teeth, pulled her shawl tighter around her shoulders, then consulted her watch; she seemed to be counting off seconds with the beat of her index finger. She then snapped her fingers so loud, it sounded like bones breaking, and one of her international dentist-assassin-conifers dropped to the floor. The others of her entourage remained with feet rooted to the floor and paid their dead colleague no attention.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah gasped. \'91You killed her!\'92\
